  "title": "Copycat Chipotle Beef Barbacoa",
  "description": "Perfect for a taco or burrito dinner, this Mexican-inspired beef barbacoa gets heat and flavor from a sauce made with chipotle peppers, lime juice, and other tasty spices.",
